<section class="nx-panel" style="margin-top:24px"><div class="nx-panel-head"><h2>Perfiles de la comunidad</h2></div><div class="nx-panel-body"><p class="nx-note">Hasta 100 perfiles recientes. Solo perfiles con mayoría de edad declarada, correo confirmado, foto aprobada y revisión aprobada pueden aparecer en descubrimiento.</p><div class="nx-stack"><?php foreach ($profiles as $profile): ?><details class="nx-form-field" id="profile-<?= (int)$profile['id'] ?>"><summary><strong data-nx-content><?= $e($profile['username']) ?></strong> · #<?= (int)$profile['id'] ?> · <?= $e($profile['status']) ?> · revisión <?= $e($profile['review_state']) ?> · <?= (int)$profile['age'] ?> años</summary><p data-nx-content style="white-space:pre-wrap"><?= $e($profile['bio']??'') ?></p><p data-nx-content><?= $e($profile['interests']??'') ?></p><p class="nx-note">Correo <?= $profile['email_verified_at']?'confirmado':'pendiente' ?> · Foto principal <?= $profile['avatar_photo_id']?'configurada':'pendiente' ?> · Créditos virtuales <?= $e($profile['wallet_balance']) ?></p><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?= $e($csrfToken) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="profile_id" value="<?= (int)$profile['id'] ?>"><div class="nx-actions"><button class="nx-btn small" name="action" value="approve_profile">Aprobar perfil</button><button class="nx-btn small" name="action" value="reject_profile">Requiere cambios</button><button class="nx-btn small danger" name="action" value="suspend">Suspender en Dating</button><button class="nx-btn small" name="action" value="restore">Retirar suspensión</button></div></form><details style="margin-top:20px"><summary>Asignar créditos virtuales promocionales</summary><form method="post" class="nx-stack"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?= $e($csrfToken) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="grant_credits"><input type="hidden" name="profile_id" value="<?= (int)$profile['id'] ?>"><label>Créditos<input name="amount" placeholder="10.00" required inputmode="decimal"></label><label>Referencia única<input name="reference" minlength="4" maxlength="120" required></label><label>Motivo de la asignación<input name="reason" minlength="10" maxlength="255" required></label><label>Contraseña actual<input name="current_password" type="password" required maxlength="72" autocomplete="current-password"></label><p class="nx-note">Esta operación asigna créditos virtuales. No registra pagos, recargas bancarias ni movimientos de tarjeta.</p><button class="nx-btn">Registrar una sola vez</button></form></details></details><?php endforeach ?></div></div></section>
<div class="nx-operation-grid" style="margin-top:24px"><section class="nx-panel"><div class="nx-panel-head"><h2>Catálogo de regalos virtuales</h2></div><div class="nx-panel-body nx-stack"><form method="post" class="nx-stack"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?= $e($csrfToken) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="save_gift"><label>Nombre del regalo<input name="gift_name" maxlength="100" required></label><label>Coste en créditos<input name="gift_price" placeholder="2.00" required inputmode="decimal"></label><button class="nx-btn">Añadir regalo</button></form><?php foreach ($gifts as $gift): ?><div class="nx-check"><p data-nx-content><?= $e($gift['name']) ?> · <?= $e($gift['price']) ?> créditos</p><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?= $e($csrfToken) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="gift_state"><input type="hidden" name="gift_id" value="<?= (int)$gift['id'] ?>"><button class="nx-btn small" name="gift_state" value="<?= $gift['status']?'0':'1' ?>"><?= $gift['status']?'Retirar del catálogo':'Activar regalo' ?></button></form></div><?php endforeach ?></div></section><section class="nx-panel"><div class="nx-panel-head"><h2>Historias visibles</h2></div><div class="nx-panel-body nx-stack"><?php foreach ($stories as $story): ?><article class="nx-form-field"><p data-nx-content><?= $e($story['caption']) ?></p><form method="post"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" value="<?= $e($csrfToken) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="hide_story"><input type="hidden" name="story_id" value="<?= (int)$story['id'] ?>"><button class="nx-btn small danger">Retirar historia</button></form></article><?php endforeach ?><p class="nx-note">Las historias caducan a las 24 horas y respetan los bloqueos. Los cobros VIP, recargas y tarjetas permanecen cerrados hasta integrar una pasarela real. Los planes y registros históricos se conservan.</p></div></section></div>
